@startuml
' Figure 32.6  The secret broker
' Reading order: top to bottom. The context assembler refuses any
' held key or run token before the model sees it; the broker fills
' a system-of-record key only after the run token covers this tool
' and this itinerary, and drops it from the result.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Context\nassembler" as A <<ops>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<policy>>
participant "Broker" as B <<policy>>
participant "System\nof record" as S <<ops>>
A -[$FAIL]> A : Key in note:\nrefused
A -> G : Tool call
G -> B : Run claims
B -> S : Key filled
S --> B : Result
B --> G : Key dropped
B -[$FAIL]> G : Other trip:\nrefused
@enduml
